#: ../../api/core.md:7
msgid "Core API"
msgstr "コアAPI"

#: ../../api/core.md:9
msgid ""
"The Core API is the public facade for component contracts, graphs, state,"
" and compiled plans. For ordinary extensions, import names from "
"`saealib.core` rather than referring directly to implementation-module "
"paths."
msgstr ""
"コアAPIは、コンポーネント契約、グラフ、状態、コンパイル済み計画の公開ファサードです。 通常の拡張では `saealib.core` "
"から名前を取得し、実装モジュールのパスを直接参照しません。"

